{
    "title": "WordBit Ingl\u00e9s",
    "description": "\u2753\u2754 Why do you constantly lose the opportunity to study English? \u2753\u2757\r\nThere is a way to increase your English proficiency using the time I didn't know you had!\r\nWhat is the method? It is just using the lock screen. How does this work?\r\nThe moment you check your cell phone, your focus is on the screen. You are free from what you just did and are ready to receive new information.\r\nRight now, WordBit uses your attention for a short period to study English.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\uddeb\ud83c\uddf7 French \ud83d\udc49 http://bit.ly/appfrances\r\n\ud83c\udde9\ud83c\uddea German \ud83d\udc49 http://bit.ly/appaleman\r\n\ud83c\uddee\ud83c\uddf9 Italian \ud83d\udc49 http://bit.ly/appitaliano\r\n\ud83c\uddf8\ud83c\udde6 Arabic \ud83d\udc49 http://bit.ly/apparabe\r\n\ud83c\uddee\ud83c\uddf1 Hebrew \ud83d\udc49 http://bit.ly/apphebreo\r\n\ud83c\uddf0\ud83c\uddf7 Korean \ud83d\udc49 http://bit.ly/appcoreano\r\n\r\n<b> <font color=\"# ef007c\"> Features of this application </font> </b>\r\n<b> <font color=\"# 41baf1\"> \u25a0 Innovative method of learning via lock screen. </font> </b>\r\nWhen you check messages, watch YouTube or just watch the time, you can study dozens of words and sentences a day! This will accumulate to more than a thousand words per month, and you will learn automatically and unconsciously.\r\n\r\n<b> <font color=\"# 41baf1\"> \u25a0 Content optimized for the lock screen </font> </b>\r\nWordBit provides content in a perfect size and suitable for the lock screen and from now on learning will only take a moment. So there is no need to stop doing your things!\r\n\r\n<b> <font color=\"# 41baf1\"> \u25a0 Useful examples </font> </b>\r\nWith the examples, you can learn how to use words in everyday life.\r\n\r\n<b> <font color=\"# 41baf1\"> \u25a0 Vocabulary categories sorted by level </font> </b>\r\nYou can study words and phrases according to your level. (More than 10,000 words from basic to advanced)\r\n\r\n<b> <font color=\"# 41baf1\"> \u25a0 Additional content </font> </b>\r\n-Sonyms\r\n-Antonyms\r\n-Nouns: Items are distinguished by color, plural forms\r\n-Verbs: the short and long version of the conjugation tables is provided\r\n-Adjectives: comparative, superlative forms\r\n-Grammar types: irregular verbs, irregular articles\r\n\r\n<b> <font color=\"# 41baf1\"> \u25a0 Patterns </font> </b>\r\nYou can study conversations using patterns.\r\nIf you learn a pattern, you can apply it in several sentences. Learning patterns allow you to use sentences more efficiently.\r\n\r\n<b> <font color=\"# ef007c\"> Well organized, rich content </font> </b>\r\n\u25a0 Prayers\r\nYou can also learn commonly used sentences.\r\n\u25a0 Various categories of idioms, Proverbs, etc.\r\n\u25a0 images for beginners\r\n\u25a0 Pronunciation - Automatic pronunciation and display of accent marks.\r\n\r\n<b> <font color=\"# ef007c\"> Extremely useful features for users </font> </b>\r\n\u25a0 Quiz, cover mode\r\n\u25a0 Daily repeat function\r\nYou can repeat as many words as you want for 24 hours.\r\n\u25a0 Custom word classification function\r\nYou can check the learned words and remove them from your study list.\r\n\u25a0 Search function\r\n\u25a0 16 different color themes (dark themes available)\r\n\r\n----------------------------------\r\n<b> <font color=\"# ef007c\"> Content we offer </font> </b>\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcd7 \u25a0 Vocabulary (for beginners) \ud83d\ude09\r\n\ud83c\udf31Numbers, Time\r\n\ud83c\udf31 Animals, Plants\r\n\ud83c\udf31 Food\r\n\ud83c\udf31Relationships\r\n\ud83c\udf31Other\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcd8 \u25a0 Vocabulary (by levels) \ud83d\ude03\r\n\ud83c\udf33A1\r\n\ud83c\udf33A2\r\n\ud83c\udf33B1\r\n\ud83c\udf33B2\r\n\ud83c\udf33C1\r\n\ud83c\udf33C2\r\n\ud83c\udf33 Compound verbs\r\n\ud83c\udf33 Irregular verbs\r\nOlloCollocation\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcd9 \u25a0 Specific vocabulary (for exams) \ud83d\ude0e\r\n\ud83c\udf3eIELTS\r\n\ud83c\udf3eTOEFL\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcd5 \u25a0 Expressions\ud83e\udd17\r\n\ud83c\udf3f Basic expressions\r\nFraRefranes and provervios\r\n\ud83c\udf3fLove and compliments\r\n\ud83c\udf3fGerga\r\n\ud83c\udf3f Colloquial expressions\r\n\ud83c\udf3f Everyday expressions\r\n\ud83c\udf3f English for meetings\r\n\ud83c\udf3fFamous phrases\r\n\r\n\ud83d\uddc2\ufe0f \u25a0 General Patterns\r\n\ud83c\udf37 Beginner\r\n\ud83c\udf37Intermediate\r\n\ud83c\udf37Advanced\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcca \u25a0 Business Patterns\r\n\u2615 Phone call\r\n\u2615 Email\r\n\u2615Meeting\r\n\u2615Presentation\r\n\u2615 Work life\r\n\u2615Business trip\r\n\u2615Company and products\r\n\u2615 Customer service\r\n----------------------------------\r\n(\u203b Next: English course, English grammar)",
    "descriptionHTML": "\u2753\u2754 Why do you constantly lose the opportunity to study English? \u2753\u2757<br>There is a way to increase your English proficiency using the time I didn&#39;t know you had!<br>What is the method? It is just using the lock screen. How does this work?<br>The moment you check your cell phone, your focus is on the screen. You are free from what you just did and are ready to receive new information.<br>Right now, WordBit uses your attention for a short period to study English.<br><br>\ud83c\uddeb\ud83c\uddf7 French \ud83d\udc49 http://bit.ly/appfrances<br>\ud83c\udde9\ud83c\uddea German \ud83d\udc49 http://bit.ly/appaleman<br>\ud83c\uddee\ud83c\uddf9 Italian \ud83d\udc49 http://bit.ly/appitaliano<br>\ud83c\uddf8\ud83c\udde6 Arabic \ud83d\udc49 http://bit.ly/apparabe<br>\ud83c\uddee\ud83c\uddf1 Hebrew \ud83d\udc49 http://bit.ly/apphebreo<br>\ud83c\uddf0\ud83c\uddf7 Korean \ud83d\udc49 http://bit.ly/appcoreano<br><br><b> <font color=\"# ef007c\"> Features of this application </font> </b><br><b> <font color=\"# 41baf1\"> \u25a0 Innovative method of learning via lock screen. </font> </b><br>When you check messages, watch YouTube or just watch the time, you can study dozens of words and sentences a day! This will accumulate to more than a thousand words per month, and you will learn automatically and unconsciously.<br><br><b> <font color=\"# 41baf1\"> \u25a0 Content optimized for the lock screen </font> </b><br>WordBit provides content in a perfect size and suitable for the lock screen and from now on learning will only take a moment. So there is no need to stop doing your things!<br><br><b> <font color=\"# 41baf1\"> \u25a0 Useful examples </font> </b><br>With the examples, you can learn how to use words in everyday life.<br><br><b> <font color=\"# 41baf1\"> \u25a0 Vocabulary categories sorted by level </font> </b><br>You can study words and phrases according to your level. (More than 10,000 words from basic to advanced)<br><br><b> <font col