\ud83c\udf3f Basic expressions<br>FraRefranes and provervios<br>\ud83c\udf3fLove and compliments<br>\ud83c\udf3fGerga<br>\ud83c\udf3f Colloquial expressions<br>\ud83c\udf3f Everyday expressions<br>\ud83c\udf3f English for meetings<br>\ud83c\udf3fFamous phrases<br><br>\ud83d\uddc2\ufe0f \u25a0 General Patterns<br>\ud83c\udf37 Beginner<br>\ud83c\udf37Intermediate<br>\ud83c\udf37Advanced<br><br>\ud83d\udcca \u25a0 Business Patterns<br>\u2615 Phone call<br>\u2615 Email<br>\u2615Meeting<br>\u2615Presentation<br>\u2615 Work life<br>\u2615Business trip<br>\u2615Company and products<br>\u2615 Customer service<br>----------------------------------<br>(\u203b Next: English course, English grammar)",
